{"4895240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bunnyhoppers", "steam_appid": 4895240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunnyhoppers is a fast-paced 3D platformer where speed and precision are the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the bunnyhop mechanic to gain momentum and complete a variety of themed levels as quickly as possible. Every level contains multiple checkpoints, recording both your checkpoint split times and your final completion time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch freely between first-person and third-person perspective and challenge yourself to achieve your best time in every level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 3D platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunnyhop-based movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person and third-person gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with unique themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple checkpoints in every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint split times and level completion times</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunnyhoppers is a fast-paced 3D platformer where speed and precision are the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the bunnyhop mechanic to gain momentum and complete a variety of themed levels as quickly as possible. Every level contains multiple checkpoints, recording both your checkpoint split times and your final completion time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch freely between first-person and third-person perspective and challenge yourself to achieve your best time in every level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 3D platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunnyhop-based movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person an